WEBVTT

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.900
If I only had the courage...

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.530
But I can't tell them.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.170
I can't!

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:55.740
We're opening tomorrow.

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:59.380
If we sell a lot, we're gonna get our magic spheres too!

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:00.430
Yep.

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:02.880
This is our shop!

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:05.540
Alright, let's do our best!

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:07.400
Yeah!

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:19.280
Grand Opening! Maho-dou

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:25.700
It's morning!

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:29.670
Dear...

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:31.210
Yes?

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:36.640
You said you'd fix the gutter today, didn't you?

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:37.760
D-did I?

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.760
But the weather's good today.

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:42.680
It's the best time for fishing...

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.350
I'd say it's a good chance to fix it because the weather's good!

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:48.810
C-Can't breathe...

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:52.760
Fishing, fishing, fishing, that's all you care about.

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:53.980
Why don't you think of the house for a change?

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.980
There they go again.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:57.730
So what if I like fishing? Get off my case!

00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:58.950
Waaah! I'm late, I'm late!

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:00.000
Gangway, gangway!

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.450
I'm leaving now!

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:03.530
Huh?

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:05.160
Doremi?

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.790
She's up awfully early.

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.040
Did she get a boyfriend?

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:10.210
That can't be, can it?

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:19.120
Check, check, check...

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:21.590
Outside is an OK!

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:26.530
I hope a lot of customers come.

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:28.860
That's all I want.

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:30.110
Is the inside an OK too?

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:31.230
All's OK!

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:34.350
Well then, the Maho-dou is now open!

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:38.190
Yay!

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:39.770
We did great, didn't we?

00:03:39.770 --> 00:03:40.560
Yes, we did!

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:41.390
This store is great.

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:42.600
What's so great about it?

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:44.430
You redecorated the whole store without permission!

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:46.280
Who'd want to come into the store now?

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.620
What's with you?

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:50.790
You didn't have that many customers before anyway, did you?

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:03.150
Yeah, we put up lotsa posters and fliers. Customers'll definitely come!

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:03.960
Right, right.

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:04.550
Lala!

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:11.120
We made these magic goods with all our hearts.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:13.000
It'd be nice to sell a lot of them.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.540
If they make everyone happy, that'll be the best!

00:04:16.540 --> 00:04:17.270
Hmph!

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:20.610
What's so good about merchandise made by witch apprentices?

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:21.780
Meanie!

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:24.440
Why do you always say such mean things?

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:25.430
I know!

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:27.560
Majo Rika's feelin' left out.

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:28.410
So she's poutin'.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.370
D-Don't say such idiotic things!

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:32.060
You hit a nerve.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:33.250
Seems like it!

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:35.830
Shut up!

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.430
I couldn't tell them again today...

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:55.520
I really am a coward.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:02.210
"Come to the Maho-dou for your magic goods!"

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.990
"For your happiness..."

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:07.820
If magic were real, there wouldn't be a problem!

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:25.880
It's already one o'clock.

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:28.850
No customers yet.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:32.270
See?

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:35.100
There are no customers even though you redecorated the store.

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:38.400
What's important to selling magic is the image!

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.360
We need the mysterious image the store used to have.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.300
Mysterious?

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:46.030
It was more like creepy.

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:51.320
No normal person'd come into a store like that.

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:54.110
Stop this nonsense and throw out this junk!

00:05:54.110 --> 00:05:55.810
Redecorate the store like it used to be!

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:56.710
No way!

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:58.840
We ain't givin' up that easily.

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:02.550
We've made such an effort, so please wait a little longer.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:04.550
I've had enough!

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:10.470
What?

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:11.140
What is it?

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.740
Fire?

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:16.480
Get water! Water!

00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:18.940
Hurry! Hurry!

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:26.180
Who're you?

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:27.950
Why'd you come out from there?

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:35.090
~ Hear ye! Hear ye! ~

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:39.240
~ I'm a wholesaler witch from the Witch World. ~

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:45.250
~ They call me Dela! ~

00:06:45.810 --> 00:06:47.130
A wholesaler witch?

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:51.930
You're the new witch apprentices of Majo Rika, right?

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.460
They're troublesome witch apprentices.

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:57.390
Look what they've done to my store!

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:10.230
~ I think it's... much prettier... than before. ~

00:07:10.230 --> 00:07:14.480
~ I was right... wasn't I? ~

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:16.790
Hey, don't start singing on me!

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:18.370
Sorry, couldn't help it.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:22.420
Anyway, what do you want? Today's not rent day, is it?

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:27.300
Because Majo Rika has new apprentices...

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:35.490
We're saved!

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:38.430
The old register's fallin' apart.

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:40.390
Thanks.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:41.310
Wait.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:46.610
We don't have the money to buy a new register.

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:49.900
Buy? Isn't it a gift?

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.000
Of course not.

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:55.990
Well, since you're reopening the store, then this will do...

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:56.960
So expensive!

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:58.240
Give us a discount!

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:59.160
Please!

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:00.330
No way.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:02.500
We don't need a new machine.

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.500
The old one is enough for the apprentices.

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:07.140
W-What?

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:08.800
It's useless crying to me.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:10.450
Then I'll stop being an apprentice!

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:13.260
Majo Rika might as well stay a Witch Frog forever!

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:17.720
W-What did you say?

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:20.060
Alright, alright!

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:23.740
Then I'll add it to the bill for the magic clay at the end of the month.

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:25.270
~ Thank you! ~

00:08:28.060 --> 00:08:30.990
You made me buy something unnecessary.

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:33.860
So, I'll have you work your butts off to pay it off!

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:35.700
We know.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:39.700
I got it! If the customers ain't comin', then we'll go to the customers.

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:43.100
Welcome!

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:45.200
Come to the Maho-dou for your magic goods!

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:48.780
They'll bring happiness to anyone.

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:51.810
Ya can even just look around. Come check it out!

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:52.750
It sounds interesting,

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:54.140
Shall we go in?

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:56.050
Come on, this way.

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:02.100
Look at this! It's so cute.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:02.930
Yeah.

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:06.120
It'll make ya and yer boyfriend love each other even more.

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:08.260
I'll sell it to ya for 50 yen!

00:09:08.260 --> 00:09:09.610
Really? I'll take it, I'll take it!

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.120
I'll take one of these.

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:11.780
Sure.

00:09:13.810 --> 00:09:15.070
300 yen.

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:19.090
Here you go.

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:20.450
Thank you very much.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:23.200
Does this one have magic too?

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:24.750
It brings world peace.

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:28.670
Kidding. It'll keep you from waking up late.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:31.490
This is 200 yen. That is 300 yen.

00:09:31.490 --> 00:09:33.960
This one is... Ah, wait a second...

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:36.060
I wonder how long it'll last.

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:38.640
Either way, I'll let them enjoy it for now.

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:49.200
Huh?

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:52.230
How did I wind up <i>here</i> ?

00:09:59.940 --> 00:10:01.780
Maho-dou?

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:04.720
"Come to the Maho-dou for your magic goods!"

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:06.250
"For your happiness..."

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:09.250
Thanks, please come again.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.940
It seems we have to make more.

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:15.080
Yep! Hadzuki-chan's items are almost sold out.

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:16.970
So are Ai-chan's.

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:19.770
What's wrong, Doremi-chan?

00:10:19.770 --> 00:10:21.930
None of mine were sold.

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:23.060
No way!

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:25.720
Why only me?

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:30.020
I really am the world's unluckiest pretty girl.

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:36.880
Kotake-kun!

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:37.740
You're here!

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:42.320
What are you doing here!?

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:44.000
Doremi!

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:45.830
Fujiwara and Senoo too!

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.960
So you have an interest in magic too, Kotake?

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:53.250
N-No, I don't. I was lost.

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:57.260
By the way, are you even allowed to work?

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:58.630
I'll tell the teacher.

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:01.310
W-W-W-We're not working.

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:05.470
This is Ai-chan's aunt's cousin's grandma's store.

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:08.680
We're just helping out here.

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:11.100
You're just helping out, huh?

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:13.560
So these are the magic goods?

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:17.050
You really believe in this stuff?

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:17.820
Of course.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:18.940
Yeah!

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:21.280
Retards.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.280
Sorry if we're retards.

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:26.490
We don't want your stupid kind in here either.

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:27.450
What did you say?

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.410
What?

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:32.870
Kotake-kun, why don't you look around since you're here.

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:35.670
Here, what do you think?

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:36.290
Here.

00:11:37.870 --> 00:11:40.130
That's the one I made.

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:42.090
Doremi did?

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:44.220
What the heck is this?

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:46.350
Clay.

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:49.520
Clay? This thing?

00:11:50.630 --> 00:11:52.940
You really are clumsy!

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:55.440
If you're gonna laugh, then give it back to me!

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.560
No way!

00:11:58.560 --> 00:12:01.460
Everyone in class will laugh when they see this.

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:02.260
I'll buy it!

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:02.940
200 yen.

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:04.950
Ahh! Don't buy it!

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:07.550
Here's 200 yen.

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:08.020
Come again!

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:09.660
Thank you very much.

00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:12.090
It's mine now.

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:13.120
Later.

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:17.720
Why Kotake, of all people?

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:20.460
That kid came here for a reason.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:24.130
Unfortunately he chose an apprentice's item.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.810
A reason?

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:27.850
Majo Rika, what do you mean by that?

00:12:28.670 --> 00:12:34.840
Those who have problems or great desires will find this place.

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:40.100
It's a pity he bought an ineffective item.

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:42.850
How can it be ineffective?

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:45.280
But... If that's true...

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:49.370
Well... Kotake's problem must be something stupid anyway.

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:53.160
No, I'm wrong.

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:54.750
I'm worried now!

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:55.640
Doremi-chan!

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:56.670
What's the matter?

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:33.660
Not here.

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:36.540
Not here either.

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:39.920
Where the heck is he?

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:44.050
Ah! There he is!

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:46.720
Doremi.

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:53.100
S-Shoot! I yelled out without thinking.

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:54.640
Huh?

00:13:56.840 --> 00:14:00.770
W-What is it? You can't take it back now!

00:14:01.430 --> 00:14:04.820
'Cuz I'll bring it to class and make everyone laugh.

00:14:21.030 --> 00:14:23.630
It's not like I'm following you or anything.

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:25.630
It just so happens that I'm going this way too.

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:27.170
Humph!

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:36.230
You are following me!

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:37.600
N-No, I'm not.

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:40.190
I... just want to buy some juice.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.650
You could've bought some juice in the convenience store just now.

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:47.280
But I like the juice from the store ahead of us!

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:52.240
That's what you say. But you actually like me don't you?

00:14:56.950 --> 00:15:00.830
Are you stupid!? Who would like you!?

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:03.670
Then don't follow me.

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:05.300
Hey!

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:07.860
What?

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:10.430
Are you worried about something?

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:14.430
W-W-Worried?

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:17.120
Of course not.

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:18.230
Later!

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:23.110
I'm still worried.

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:24.440
Alright.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.660
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:54.300
Waaah! Not that way!

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:02.060
Misora Industries
Do Not Enter

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:08.480
Where did he go?

00:16:19.150 --> 00:16:21.960
I see, you were lonely?

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:24.920
I'm sorry I left you here alone, Pal.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:28.130
I know, I'm sorry. It's all my fault.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:32.670
So Kotake's been keeping a puppy here...

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:36.970
You must be hungry. Drink up!

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:40.600
I'm sorry.

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:43.430
I want to let you live in a better place,

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:47.940
but Dad and Mom won't let me have a pet.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:51.360
They don't think I could take care of you properly.

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:55.490
If only I had the courage to ask them...

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.790
Finished already?

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:10.990
Then, here.

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:12.260
You like this?

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:19.140
Stop, you stupid cat!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:22.390
Pal, don't!

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:34.840
Pal!

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:37.280
Pal, Pal, where are you?

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:40.960
He can't be...

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:42.240
Ahh! Pal!

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:47.460
Hold on, I'm coming for you!

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:05.770
Oh no! I have to get someone!

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:11.860
What should I do?

00:18:13.810 --> 00:18:16.940
They could be buried alive by the time I get help.

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:19.660
I'll have to save them myself!

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:33.800
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:36.010
Sand, harden!

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:44.510
Ah! No way! They froze over!

00:18:48.050 --> 00:18:49.690
It's cold!

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:51.060
What's going on?

00:18:53.390 --> 00:18:56.070
At this rate, Kotake and Pal will die here.

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.110
Hey!

00:18:57.110 --> 00:19:00.160
Anyone? Someone help!

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:01.450
What should I do?

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:02.660
It's so cold.

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:04.540
Isn't there anyone up there?

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:07.160
Lucky! If I use that rope...

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:10.010
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:11.750
Rope, descend!

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:17.260
I did it.

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:26.990
Is someone there? If you are, please help us!

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:29.600
Here, we're in the pit!

00:19:34.510 --> 00:19:37.020
Come on! Get a hold of yourself, Doremi.

00:19:37.020 --> 00:19:40.400
You'll never be a witch at this rate.

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:43.120
This time for sure...

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:46.410
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:48.870
Anything's fine, just save Kotake!

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:02.130
Wait, that's not what I want!

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:24.950
Maybe we can get out this way, Pal.

00:20:34.530 --> 00:20:35.670
I did it.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:37.630
We're out, Pal.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:40.670
I've made up my mind.

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:45.400
I'm not going to leave you in such a dangerous place.

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:48.260
I'll try asking Dad and Mom.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:52.370
I'll do whatever I can to make them agree.

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:54.060
That way they will...

00:20:56.610 --> 00:20:58.690
Great!

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:02.610
That's not great at all. I have to save myself now!

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:06.070
I'm out of magic spheres.

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:07.820
I can't get down!

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:11.160
Somebody? Somebody help me!

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:14.160
I can't take it anymore...

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:23.420
I really am the world's unluckiest pretty girl.

00:21:25.670 --> 00:21:28.220
I'm off.

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:32.890
Pal, you can't come with me.

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:36.640
Go back inside.

00:21:37.720 --> 00:21:39.650
I'm off!

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:48.240
Looks like Kotake-kun's allowed to keep the puppy now.

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:51.310
Doremi-chan's magic item really worked!

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:52.580
You think so?

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:53.660
Yep.

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:55.000
Yeah, yeah.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:56.580
I'll leave it at that then.

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:04.130
I'm so mad! Why does she hafta lie?

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:07.340
Nobuko-chan is a liar, but she really is a good person.

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:09.550
Right, right! She wouldn't tell cruel lies.

00:22:09.550 --> 00:22:12.470
There's bad lies and good lies, right?

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:15.180
I'm never gonna forgive her!

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:20.100
Ai-chan's gotten this angry...
Nobuko-chan, what did you say to her?

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:22.700
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:22.700 --> 00:22:24.860
A Liar's First Friendship.

00:22:25.650 --> 00:22:27.990
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
